  'Data Engineer \u00b7 Builder \u00b7 Lifelong Learner',
  'Turning raw data into real impact',
  'Eagle Scout \u00b7 Data Nerd \u00b7 Family Man',
  'Building pipelines by day, Pok\u00e9mon teams by night',
  'Pittsburgh roots, Detroit drive',
  'Agentic AI enthusiast with a pixel font obsession',
  'Disc golf \u00b7 Big data \u00b7 Bigger ambitions',
  'Catholic \u00b7 Husband \u00b7 Engineer \u00b7 Dreamer',
  'Saving Ford millions, one pipeline at a time',
  'Former marching band percussionist turned data engineer',
  'If it can be measured, it can be improved',
