  'Penn State grad \u00b7 Ford engineer \u00b7 Perpetual student',
  'Locally running LLMs and loving every second of it',
  'Quads player turned query optimizer',
  'Faith, family, and a well-tuned SQL query',
  'VGC competitor \u00b7 Data pipeline architect \u00b7 Dog dad',
  'There\u2019s nothing more extraordinary than the ordinary man',
  'Ctrl+S is my love language',
